+| **Workspace Settings Descriptions** | `color` | `--kb-color-text-secondary` (`#475569`) on `#ffffff` | 7.0:1 | `--kb-color-text-secondary` (`#94a3b8`) on `#111827` | 6.5:1 | PASS (>= 4.5:1) |
