+| **Promoted Sticky Stub Title** | `color` | `--kb-color-text-primary` (`#0f172a`) on `#ffffff` | 15.6:1 | `--kb-color-text-primary` (`#f9fafb`) on `#1e293b` | 14.8:1 | PASS (>= 4.5:1) |
